{"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.7716049391467531,"y":0.046511627815394085,"w":0.069958845774332645,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.5,"t":"1718867188"},{"t":"Sample Writing answers","c":1,"h":0.014536595878106739,"w":0.21604937235514321,"x":0.11522634243634533,"y":0.053779069623613118},{"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 2","c":1,"y":0.097383721316210314,"x":0.11522634095693685,"w":0.33744855244954425,"h":0.018929588219021354},{"c":1,"y":0.13221436958309818,"w":0.65226338704427089,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score.","x":0.11522633105551232,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"t":"Since ancient times people tried to treat themselves by herbals and another natural products. In","c":1,"y":0.15694935200665416,"h":0.017469252798666735,"x":0.11522634047682487,"w":0.75720163981119804},{"t":"these days this type of treatment is named as alternative medicine. Nowadays, more and more","h":0.017518900589330699,"y":0.17579505305297549,"x":0.1152263433110492,"c":1,"w":0.73868311564127609},{"y":0.19464075409782966,"c":1,"x":0.11728394547131207,"t":"people with some diseases decide to use alternative medicines instead of classic medicine. In this","w":0.75514404296875004,"h":0.017667844522968323},{"h":0.01751034054795475,"y":0.21511627890413021,"t":"essay I will try to discuss pros and cons.","x":0.1152263392399782,"c":1,"w":0.32098765055338541},{"x":0.11522633233814361,"w":0.75514404296875004,"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"In my opinion, the disadvantages outweigh the advantages of using traditional medicine. The first","y":0.24116607773557952,"c":1},{"h":0.01750520486011653,"c":1,"t":"reason is that nobody knows how this treatment will affect to a person's health. There are a lot of","x":0.11522634773187235,"w":0.76543207804361979,"y":0.26017441844497657},{"t":"cases when using different herbals caused allergic reaction and some people dead. The next reason","y":0.27906976782970294,"w":0.77366256713867188,"h":0.018927876323075465,"c":1,"x":0.11522632950086707},{"t":"is that people who do not have any medical education try alternative medicines. They do not know","x":0.1152263477181943,"w":0.76543207804361979,"h":0.018895348053517669,"y":0.29796511666723946,"c":1},{"h":0.017441860778592888,"x":0.11522632480170217,"t":"what the result will be and hope that it will be positive but not always is like that.","y":0.31831395332807422,"c":1,"w":0.63786010742187504},{"h":0.017441860778592888,"y":0.34447674402678774,"t":"Although there are a lot of disadvantages, advantages might make people not go to usual doctor.","c":1,"x":0.11728394454189688,"w":0.76131688435872413},{"c":1,"y":0.36336866907171839,"w":0.78395060221354163,"h":0.017445284570485109,"t":"The first and the main pro is that using herbals does not cause environmental problems such as air","x":0.11522634486476553},{"w":0.77572016398111987,"c":1,"t":"pollution or gas waste. Many pharmaceutical plants use chemicals which have harmful affect on the","h":0.017494932361148963,"x":0.11522633765054972,"y":0.38221437011851189},{"c":1,"t":"environment. The other reason is that alternative medicines are usually much cheaper than usual","h":0.019483098994997672,"w":0.76145751953125007,"y":0.39980855212504918,"x":0.11516285486063453},{"h":0.018987797174352727,"c":1,"y":0.42005813969053762,"x":0.11522633772354453,"t":"treatment as you do not have to go to pharmacy and buy expensive drugs.","w":0.58436213175455731},{"x":0.11316871632131666,"w":0.77366256713867188,"y":0.44758539480141535,"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"To sum it up, the alternative treatment will be forever because it has some advantages which many","c":1},{"w":0.73045267740885411,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"x":0.11728394927472692,"y":0.46643109528594739,"t":"people think that they can outweigh the disadvantages but I do not think so. The conventional"},{"w":0.67078191121419273,"t":"medicine which develops rocketly will drive out other types of treatment in the future.","h":0.017479524735988794,"x":0.11522632820322912,"y":0.4854651161183674,"c":1},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.52031802127259497,"c":1,"x":0.11728394794614067,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","w":0.29423868815104165},{"y":0.55076839985994941,"w":0.67512090047200524,"c":1,"h":0.018913918305341948,"x":0.16037612620308114,"t":"The response addresses both sides of the question and the candidate states"},{"t":"their position in the second paragraph. The disadvantages presented include not","y":0.56976744172773108,"w":0.71193415323893228,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.16049382862774736,"c":1},{"t":"knowing if the treatments will work, possible allergic reactions and the dangers","y":0.58568904593195459,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.1604938232431431,"w":0.69135803222656245},{"x":0.1604938305096755,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"of untrained practitioners. The advantages include remedies being kinder to the","y":0.60306242664298926,"w":0.69958847045898442,"c":1},{"t":"environment and usually cheaper.","y":0.6191860463587624,"x":0.1604938235673192,"w":0.30041152954101569,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"y":0.65253239096738513,"w":0.65020573933919268,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"Ideas are arranged coherently with a range of cohesive devices, although","x":0.15843622487740211},{"h":0.016024324441826665,"y":0.66860465101649291,"t":"organisation is sometimes mechanical due to the high number of linking devices.","c":1,"x":0.16049382862980857,"w":0.71193415323893239},{"c":1,"t":"There is evidence of referencing [chemicals which | it] with some error [that they","x":0.16049382953373556,"y":0.6845930231059878,"w":0.70576131184895829,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"y":0.70200235585366655,"h":0.016020900088288936,"c":1,"w":0.23045267740885414,"t":"can outweigh \/ outweigh].","x":0.16049382588848829},{"t":"Vocabulary is used adequately and there are some good examples used [allergic","x":0.15838205939847039,"y":0.73398146235805062,"h":0.01732965858019142,"c":1,"w":0.71615229288736981},{"c":1,"y":0.75145348822451652,"w":0.70576131184895841,"x":0.1584362163514417,"t":"reaction | pharmaceutical plants | conventional medicine]; however, some errors","h":0.01598837238037687},{"c":1,"h":0.017912667547434924,"y":0.76706400522265472,"t":"remain [dead \/ die | rocket\/y \/ very quickly]. Grammatical structures include some","x":0.15836479664619049,"w":0.71412801106770829},{"x":0.16040927668234445,"w":0.70799835205078132,"h":0.018482089744720653,"c":1,"y":0.78296970647943964,"t":"sentences with multiple clauses [which have | as you]. However, there are errors"},{"t":"[not always is like that \/ it is not always] and most sentences are short and simple.","c":1,"x":0.16049383699741837,"w":0.72427983601888024,"y":0.80087209321203823,"h":0.014534882858869391},{"t":"138","c":1,"x":0.1172839510049765,"w":0.034979422887166337,"y":0.86773255797837645,"h":0.013081395583944611}],"h":3395}